{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/golden-mile-nakheel-palm-jumeirah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":559,"crm_id":"1065","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Golden Mile","slug":"golden-mile-nakheel-palm-jumeirah","display_address":"Palm Jumeirah","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2009","developer":"Nakheel","price":2800000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.1055666,"longitude":55.1464768,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Golden Mile is a residential and commercial real estate complex of 11 towers from the renowned developer Nakheel Properties. It is located on the seafront of Palm Jumeirah.</p><p>Residential real estate in the project is represented by apartments with <strong>1-3 bedrooms</strong>, as well as townhouses and penthouses. The objects are located in 10-storey buildings of the same style. The lower floors are surrounded by a podium, between the buildings there are transitions. The facade is decorated with arched windows, carved balconies and mezzanines similar to the ancient towers on the city walls.</p><p>The layout of the apartments includes a living room, kitchen, bedrooms and bathrooms. The interior is complemented by built-in dressing rooms. On the upper floors there are two-level penthouses with terraces and panoramic windows with sea views.</p><p>Residents have access to a large number of amenities, including swimming pools, children's playground, parking, SPA-salons, business center, multifunctional rooms for events and conferences, barbecue areas, private beach area at Palace Beach, 24-hour concierge service.</p><p>The neighborhood has a developed social infrastructure. Nearby there is a high school, kindergartens and clinics. From Golden Mile to the mainland of the city can be reached by bridge. The road to the center will take 14 minutes. Al Maktoum Airport is a 35-minute drive away. Al Ittihad Park is nearby. The complex benefits from the presence of its own shopping center on the territory. It has 70 stores, cafes, restaurants, sports and medical centers.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1065/images/2024/02/21/HK3qY8cRbqMRIIghh8kaiXtsT0DQ69D8R3KgGkvT.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/21/HK3qY8cRbqMRIIghh8kaiXtsT0DQ69D8R3KgGkvT.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1065/images/2024/02/21/bRQpXOc2Qhx2Prw44vm6xYmaBRbZvTY1Wtm4DCmI.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/21/bRQpXOc2Qhx2Prw44vm6xYmaBRbZvTY1Wtm4DCmI.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1065/images/2024/02/21/RJJIdGONtUvX15nkzTq7ugpEDJVp0khPfFKKc8nu.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/21/RJJIdGONtUvX15nkzTq7ugpEDJVp0khPfFKKc8nu.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1065/images/2024/02/21/xCA6VGh9tZ0CTkMssSWPig7HeW6O24tPk5TyXfMe.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/21/xCA6VGh9tZ0CTkMssSWPig7HeW6O24tPk5TyXfMe.png","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2865,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/02/28/gCu44qpqoUR3nvRWeZ9Sb9oxDx1CMYm4lIVn8vRy.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1120,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"","payment_plans":[],"community":"Palm Jumeirah","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":9232,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9233,"url":null,"text":"Concierge Service","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9234,"url":null,"text":"Children’s pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9235,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool",